	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d06r0101_swbell_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ベル『しってる？▼
ういている　いしは
おせば　うごくんだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-20T08:02:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ベル『知ってる？▼
浮いている　石は
押せば　動くんだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-20T08:02:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
