	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d06r0101_mission_add_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんて　キレイな　いし　なの！▼
へやの　あちこちに
こんなに　キレイな　いしを▽
かざることが　できたら　ステキよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T12:59:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T02:50:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんて　キレイな　石なの！▼
部屋の　あちこちに
こんなに　キレイな　石を▽
飾ることが　できたら　ステキよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T13:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T02:50:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・フェス用システムフラグがOFF</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T02:50:05" />
		</CommentCell>
